<!-- ════════════════ 33 · EXAMPLE · MCP ════════════════ -->
  <section data-label="Example: mcp" class="slide light cat-themed" style="--c: #9333ea;">
    <div class="glow soft"></div>
    <div class="frame">
      <div class="cat-head">
        <span class="cat-icon">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.75" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><polyline points="16 18 22 12 16 6"/><polyline points="8 6 2 12 8 18"/></svg>
        </span>
        <div class="cat-text">
          <p class="eyebrow"><span class="num">33</span>Example</p>
          <h2 class="h2">Configure once, then just <span class="accent">ask</span>.</h2>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="frame-body">
      <div class="grid-2" style="margin-top: 28px; gap: 40px; align-content: start;">

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab">1 &middot; Configure once</span>
          <div class="ide">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">.mcp.json</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body">{
  <span class="key">"mcpServers"</span>: {
    <span class="key">"postgres"</span>: {
      <span class="key">"command"</span>: <span class="str">"npx"</span>,
      <span class="key">"args"</span>: [<span class="str">"mcp-postgres"</span>]
    }
  }
}</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">Same JSON everywhere; Copilot uses <code>servers</code> and the path differs per tool (<code>.vscode/</code>, <code>.mcp.json</code>, <code>.cursor/</code>).</p>
        </div>

        <div class="ide-col">
          <span class="lab">2 &middot; Then just ask</span>
          <div class="ide ide-claude">
            <div class="ide-bar">
              <span class="ide-dots"><span class="ide-dot r"></span><span class="ide-dot y"></span><span class="ide-dot g"></span></span>
              <span class="ide-file">agent</span>
            </div>
            <pre class="ide-body"><span class="pr">&gt;</span> Which columns are on the
  <span class="str">sessions</span> table? Write a query
  for the ones active in the last hour.
<span class="ok">⏺</span> postgres &middot; describe <span class="str">"sessions"</span>
<span class="ok">⏺</span> postgres &middot; query (read-only)</pre>
          </div>
          <p class="ide-cap">The agent reads the schema itself. You never pasted it.</p>
        </div>

      </div>

      <div class="callout">
        MCP turns &ldquo;paste the schema, the log, the docs&rdquo; into <strong>&ldquo;the agent fetches exactly what it needs&rdquo;</strong>: less context, and always current.
      </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    {% set slideNumber = "33" %}
    {% set slideTotal = "57" %}
    {% include "../../shared/chrome.njk" %}
  </section>
